  designNotes: "Beat 3: prioritise. Snipers on the tower out-damage everything on
    the field (20 dmg at 16 hp) so they are the read, and they are the FURTHEST target
    \u2014 the player must choose between the near bunker and the real threat. Bunker
    moved 3.8 -> 5.5 to bring tank->dominant separation from 13.3 into range. Rule
    7 warns and is ACCEPTED: the back rank (the tank crew) needs 103% power to reach
    the snipers, so its 2 rounds fall short while the front rank reaches at 92%. The
    snipers being the furthest AND highest target is the beat; pulling them in to
    silence the warning is pulling the level's teeth.
    Structure hp RETUNED 2026-08-07: bunker hpScale 0.5 (250 -> 125), garrisoned total 340
    -> 215. A stock squad can only ever do 288 structure damage in a battle (3 tank shells
    x 96; a rifleman does 2), so a garrison behind more than that cannot be dug out at
    stock. The bunker takes the cut because the TOWER snipers are the beat."
